2. State-issued ID, such as a driver’s license;

3. Pay stub;

4. Birth certificate;

5. Voter registration card;

6. Library card;

7. U.S. passport;

8. IEVS match;

9. Numerical identification (Numident) match with the Social Security Administration;

10. Baptismal certificate;

11. Military ID or service papers;

